========================================================================
Ansatz: U_r =?= alpha(q,t) [r+2]_t + beta(q,t) t^r [r]_t + ...
Try:  U_r = [ f1(q,t) + f2(q,t) t^r + f3(q,t) t^(2r+2) ] / (t-1)
========================================================================
    (t-1)*U_2 expanded = q*t**6 - q*t**5 + q*t**4 - 2*q*t**3 + q*t**2 - q*t + q + t**4 - 1
    (t-1)*U_3 expanded = q*t**8 - q*t**7 + q*t**6 - q*t**5 - q*t**3 + q*t**2 - q*t + q + t**5 - 1
    (t-1)*U_4 expanded = q*t**10 - q*t**9 + q*t**8 - q*t**7 + q*t**6 - 2*q*t**5 + q*t**4 - q*t**3 + q*t**2 - q*t + q + t**6 - 1
    (t-1)*U_5 expanded = q*t**12 - q*t**11 + q*t**10 - q*t**9 + q*t**8 - q*t**7 - q*t**5 + q*t**4 - q*t**3 + q*t**2 - q*t + q + t**7 - 1

  Fit on r = 2,3,4:
    A = (q - t - 1)/(t + 1)
    B = -t*(q - t)
    C = q*t/(t + 1)
    r = 5 diff = 0  MATCH? True

========================================================================
Try: (t-1) * U_r = P(q,t) + Q(q,t) t^(2r+2)
========================================================================
  A = -(q*t**4 - q - t**5 + t + 1)/(t + 1)
  B = (q*t**4 - q + t)/(t**3*(t + 1))
  r = 4: MATCH? False
  r = 5: MATCH? False

========================================================================
Ansatz: (t-1)*U_r = A + B t^r + C t^(r+1) + D t^(2r+2)
========================================================================
  A = (q - t - 1)/(t + 1)
  B = -t*(C + q - t)
  C = nan
  D = q*t/(t + 1)
